                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/4193: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Geneva</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Gilbert</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Geneva</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-09-27T19:00:00+01:00">September 27, 1934—7
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received September 27—5:20 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>277. The resolution cited in my 274, September 26, 8 p.m., was adopted at the
                    closing meeting of the Assembly session this afternoon.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gilbert</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
